==============================================================================
 RESTAURANT RUSH - you are the manager
==============================================================================
 18 turns, 2 tables. Win: >= 4 paid customers, revenue >= $45.00, average satisfaction >= 60.
 Each turn you give the Waiter and the Chef one task each (or 'wait'). Commands:
   seat <n>   Waiter: seat queued customer n at a free table
   order <n>  Waiter: take seated customer n's order
   serve <n>  Waiter: serve customer n's READY order
   cook <n>   Chef: advance customer n's order by one preparation unit
   wait       do nothing with this staff member (an empty line works too)
   help, quit

